/* OPTIONAL build-time settings. Copy to config.h (gitignored) only if you
 * want to bake values into your own build; every line is optional and the
 * firmware builds without this file at all (see features.h):
 *   - Wi-Fi: normally set from the PandaDeck app over USB (stored in NVS).
 *   - Token: normally generated by the panel on first boot and handed to
 *     the app over USB.
 * Values here are fallbacks: the app's settings win. */
